{
  "about": [
    "Archive key fingerprints (wappie DS49): the lowercase hex SHA-256 of an",
    "archive public key's 32 raw X25519 bytes, 64 characters, no prefix",
    "(store.ArchiveKeyFingerprint). A grant.add names the key it seals by this.",
    "Read by internal/store's TestArchiveKeyFingerprint, packages/cli's tests,",
    "and wappie-cloud's web tests from the core checkout its CI pins. Where a",
    "private_key is given, its public half (X25519 of the base point, the key",
    "clamped as RFC 7748 says) is public_key: a client fingerprints the key it",
    "opened. The two private keys are RFC 7748's section 6.1 test keys."
  ],
